-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"א/4, 2 December 2020: העסקת עובד הוראה, עובדי בעלות,
-- בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים, בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש
-- בשנה"ל תשפ"א
-- אופק חדש in the recognised unofficial special-education kindergartens:
-- the owner's and the Ministry's first-stage actions and their deadlines,
-- who joins, leaving the reform, the kindergarten teacher's job base, day
-- and position, health professions, part-time and above-100% employment,
-- mothers and age hours, activity hours, promotion, the grade, the
-- advances, and the annexes (the owner's commitment, the advance letter and
-- undertaking, three forms, and the table of employment options).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in DAYS from the circular's
-- date, 2 December 2020 (day 0), except where a rule says otherwise.
`1 January 2021`  MEANS 30
`31 January 2021` MEANS 60

§ `חוזר תשפ"א/4 אופק חדש בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (2.12.2020), reference number, addressee (the owners of recognised unofficial special-education kindergartens), greeting and subject line; no rule.

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_1/p1 Background: the State's notice in HCJ 6677/19 (the recognised unofficial schools' forum) that it would equalise teaching resources; it states the reason, not a rule.
-- akn:art_1/p2 Background: the inter-ministerial team and the Director-General's decision to adopt its conclusions from תשפ"א; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p3 A pointer to the team's report; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p4 The report's link; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p7 The circular's purpose, for תשפ"א; no rule beyond the sections below.

-- ¶5: from תשפ"א the terms of אופק חדש apply to the recognised unofficial
-- special-education kindergartens.
@ref akn:art_1/p5
GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year in which the school year begins (תשפ"א = 2020)
      `recognised unofficial special-education kindergarten` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `אופק חדש applies to the kindergarten` `school year beginning` `recognised unofficial special-education kindergarten` IF
        `recognised unofficial special-education kindergarten`
    AND `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2020

-- ¶6 (and 11.1): the Ministry of Education alone approves joining, sets
-- the grade, converts the salary, and sets the education grade and the
-- seniority.
@ref akn:art_1/p6 akn:art_11/p3
DECLARE `reform decision` IS ONE OF
    `approving a teacher's joining`
    `setting the אופק חדש grade`
    `converting the salary`
    `setting the education grade`
    `setting the seniority in teaching`

GIVEN d IS A `reform decision`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides` d IS
    `the Ministry of Education`

§§ `2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

DECLARE `kindergarten action` IS ONE OF
    `send the commitment through the portal`
    `send the staff file through the portal`
    `identify the teachers who meet the joining conditions`
    `employ the eligible teachers on אופק חדש terms`
    `adjust the length of the kindergarten day`
    `set the timetable by the אופק חדש work week`
    `approve the owner's joining`
    `hear the exception requests`
    `hear the requests to leave`
    `file an exception request`
    `file the academic-studies commitment`
    `file a request to leave`
    `impose sanctions on the owner`
    `monitor the academic-studies commitment`
    `present proof of an academic degree`
    `complete the degree and the teaching certificate`
    `place a kindergarten teacher above the ceiling` HAS `scope placed` IS A NUMBER
                                                         `weekly hours placed` IS A NUMBER
    `allocate activity hours` HAS `activity hours in the half` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the אופק חדש advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `mark the advance on the payslip`
    `send each teacher the advance letter`
    `have each teacher sign the advance undertaking`
    `keep the undertakings and send them on demand`
    `have the unqualified sign a completion commitment`
    `send the payslips on demand`
    `transfer the data required`

-- 2.1.1(1): until the regulations (Education (Recognised Institutions),
-- 1953) are amended, the owner signs the commitment (its text below, in
-- art_13) and sends it ONLY through the authorities' and owners' portal,
-- by 1.1.2021; annexes A and B stay with the owner for management and the
-- Ministry's future audit. Breach may bring sanctions (the commitment).
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1 akn:art_13__para_7/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `sending the commitment` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the commitment through the portal`
    WITHIN `1 January 2021`
    LEST  (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
           MAY   `impose sanctions on the owner`)

-- 2.1.1(2): until the Ministry's system is built, the owner sends, first,
-- the staff of kindergarten teachers and health professionals in the Excel
-- file through the portal, by 31.1.2021: every teaching employee (not
-- administrative staff or assistants) with placement and personal details
-- as the owner holds them — details that do not bind the Ministry, which
-- will set them anew on documents to be sent later.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `sending the staff file` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the staff file through the portal`
    WITHIN `31 January 2021`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/4 2.1.1(2): the staff file is sent through the portal by 31.1.2021"

`the owner's details bind the Ministry` MEANS FALSE

-- 2.1.1(3)-(6): identify the teachers who meet the joining conditions;
-- employ them on the אופק חדש work week and pay (the advance until the
-- grade is set, section 12); adjust the kindergarten day to the reform's
-- end time (4.1.4); set the timetable by the work week. No deadline is
-- printed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_3 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_4 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owner's first stage` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `identify the teachers who meet the joining conditions`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `employ the eligible teachers on אופק חדש terms`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `adjust the length of the kindergarten day`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `set the timetable by the אופק חדש work week`)

-- 2.1.2: the Ministry approves the joining of owners that signed on time
-- and as required, joining their kindergartens to the reform in its
-- systems; it hears the requests of uncertified teachers to join by
-- exception (3.2.1) and the requests to leave the reform (3.6).
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2
GIVEN `commitment sent by` IS A NUMBER @desc the day the owner's commitment arrived, in days from 2.12.2020
      `signed as required` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry approves the owner's joining` `commitment sent by` `signed as required` IF
        `signed as required`
    AND `commitment sent by` AT MOST `1 January 2021`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's first stage` IS
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `hear the exception requests`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `hear the requests to leave`)

-- 2.2: the second stage — reporting, placement and the grade — will be
-- published separately; in it the Ministry checks the joining conditions,
-- sets the grade, computes the profile and indemnifies the owner.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2
DECLARE `second-stage step` IS ONE OF
    `checking each teacher's joining conditions`
    `setting the grade`
    `computing the אופק חדש profile`
    `indemnifying the owner in the payment system`

`the second stage's steps, the instructions to follow` MEANS
    LIST `checking each teacher's joining conditions`, `setting the grade`,
         `computing the אופק חדש profile`, `indemnifying the owner in the payment system`

§§ `3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

@desc A teaching employee of the owner at a special-education kindergarten, as far as the circular asks about her.
DECLARE `kindergarten teacher` HAS
    `recognised years of actual teaching` IS A NUMBER  @desc years of actual teaching recognised for salary seniority, internship and military or national service in teaching excluded (3.1)
    `seniority in teaching`              IS A NUMBER
    `academic`                           IS A BOOLEAN @desc a degree of an Israeli institution, a foreign degree the Ministry recognised, or an equivalent salary grade (3.1.3)
    `certified to teach`                 IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching certificate or certification otherwise under the Ministry's rules (3.1.4)
    `position fraction`                  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position (1 = 100%)
    `signed the academic-studies commitment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved as an exception`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `an intern`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `a health professional`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc occupational therapy, physiotherapy, speech therapy, or an arts therapist
    `a cluster manager`                  IS A BOOLEAN @desc a manager of a cluster of kindergartens (3.8)
    `age on 31 December`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc her age on 31 December of the school year (8.1)

-- 3.1.1-3.1.2: "new" and "existing".
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-1 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-3 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-4
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing teacher` k IF
    k's `recognised years of actual teaching` GREATER THAN 0

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic joins when, cumulatively, she holds a
-- certification to teach and is employed at a third of a position or more;
-- without the certification, by the exceptions committee.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p1 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing academic joins` k IF
        `an existing teacher` k
    AND k's `academic`
    AND k's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    AND (k's `certified to teach` OR k's `approved as an exception`)

-- 3.2.1 ¶5-¶8, 3.3.1 ¶2-¶4 and 3.6.3-3.6.5: the exception request, the
-- academic-studies commitment and the request to leave go through the
-- owner on the portal, each by 31.1.2021.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `filing an exception request` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `file an exception request`
    WITHIN `31 January 2021`

@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p2 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p3 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `filing the academic-studies commitment` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `file the academic-studies commitment`
    WITHIN `31 January 2021`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/4 3.3.1: the academic-studies commitment is filed through the portal by 31.1.2021"

-- 3.2.1 ¶9: without a certification and with less than 25 years, no
-- advancement until certified.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred from advancing until certified` k IF
        (NOT k's `certified to teach`)
    AND k's `seniority in teaching` LESS THAN 25

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-h: the same paragraph recognises the work period and
-- part of the studies "כמפורט בסעיף 12.2.2". Section 12 (the advances)
-- prints 12.1-12.3 only; the rule it describes is 10.2.2.
`the paragraphs of section 12` MEANS LIST "12.1", "12.2", "12.3"

`section 12.2.2 is not in the circular` MEANS
    NOT (elem "12.2.2" `the paragraphs of section 12`)
#ASSERT `section 12.2.2 is not in the circular`

-- 3.3.1-3.3.2: an existing non-academic with up to 27 years (inclusive)
-- joins once she signs the commitment to complete an academic education
-- within four years of signing it (annex D); with 28 years or more she need
-- not sign and is employed on the reform's terms in any case.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p1 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-2
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing non-academic joins` k IF
        `an existing teacher` k
    AND (NOT k's `academic`)
    AND (k's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 28 OR k's `signed the academic-studies commitment`)

-- 3.3.4 (and annex C ¶10-¶11): a teacher who presents the degree within
-- four years of joining is owed the salary differences back to the day of
-- joining; one who completes later moves to the academic table without
-- them. The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_04-c): one start, the day of
-- joining (3.3.4). Time in months from it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-4 akn:att_3__hc_1/p10 akn:att_3__hc_1/p11
`months to complete the degree` MEANS 48

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `completing the academic degree` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `present proof of an academic degree`
    WITHIN `months to complete the degree`
    LEST  (PARTY `the teaching employee`
           MAY   `present proof of an academic degree`)

GIVEN `months from joining to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `retroactive salary differences from joining` `months from joining to the degree` IF
    `months from joining to the degree` AT MOST `months to complete the degree`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-c: the four years run from SIGNING (3.3.1, annex C
-- ¶10) and from JOINING (3.3.4, annex C ¶11); the differences run back to
-- JOINING (3.3.4) and to SIGNING (annex C ¶11).
DECLARE `start of the four years` IS ONE OF
    `the day the commitment was signed`
    `the day of joining the reform`

`the starts the text gives for the four years` MEANS
    LIST `the day the commitment was signed`, `the day of joining the reform`
`the starts the text gives for the differences` MEANS
    LIST `the day of joining the reform`, `the day the commitment was signed`

`the four years and the differences each start on two days` MEANS
        count `the starts the text gives for the four years` EQUALS 2
    AND count `the starts the text gives for the differences` EQUALS 2
    AND (NOT (at `the starts the text gives for the four years` 0 EQUALS at `the starts the text gives for the four years` 1))
#ASSERT `the four years and the differences each start on two days`

-- 3.3.3: the commitment is monitored.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `monitoring the commitment` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `monitor the academic-studies commitment`

-- 3.4: a new teacher who is an academic, employed in an institution that
-- joined, joins with a certification to teach and at least a third of a
-- position.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-4
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins under 3.4` k IF
        (NOT `an existing teacher` k)
    AND k's `academic`
    AND k's `certified to teach`
    AND k's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 3.5.1: in a kindergarten that joined, interns are employed on the reform
-- only; the internship year counts only at a third or more, actually
-- worked for at least six months of the year (July and August excluded).
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5 akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an intern is employed on the reform` k IF
    k's `an intern`

GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
      `months at a third or more, July and August excluded` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognised` k `months at a third or more, July and August excluded` IF
        k's `an intern`
    AND `months at a third or more, July and August excluded` AT LEAST 6

-- 3.5.2: at most two years, completing the degree and the certificate
-- (time here in months from the start of the internship).
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `completing the internship requirements` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `complete the degree and the teaching certificate`
    WITHIN 24
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/4 3.5.2: an intern who has not completed the degree and certificate within two years is not employed further on the reform's terms"

-- 3.5.3: what the internship counts for: not salary seniority or the
-- minimum time for promotion; yes tenure, jubilee-grant and recuperation
-- seniority.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
DECLARE `seniority purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary seniority`
    `the minimum time for promotion (פז"נ)`
    `the period needed for tenure`
    `seniority for the jubilee grant`
    `seniority for recuperation pay`

GIVEN p IS A `seniority purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `salary seniority` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the minimum time for promotion (פז"נ)` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 3.6: joining is the rule; leaving may be heard exceptionally on these
-- grounds, on annex E's form, through the owner, by 31.1.2021.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-6 akn:art_3__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-1 akn:art_3__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2 akn:art_3__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-3 akn:art_3__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4
DECLARE `ground for leaving` IS ONE OF
    `the health of the teacher or a first-degree relative, with current medical certificates`
    `personal: a change for the worse in her circumstances after joining`
    `another ground`

GIVEN g IS A `ground for leaving`, `filed by 31 January 2021` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request to leave may be heard` g `filed by 31 January 2021` IF
        `filed by 31 January 2021`
    AND (NOT (g EQUALS `another ground`))

-- 3.6.5: the requests to leave are due by 31.1.2021.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `filing a request to leave` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `file a request to leave`
    WITHIN `31 January 2021`

-- 3.7: a substitute on weekly hours (a placement over time, such as for
-- maternity leave) is employed on the terms of the teacher replaced.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-7
GIVEN `the replaced teacher is on the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `on weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is on the reform` `the replaced teacher is on the reform` `on weekly hours` IF
    `on weekly hours` AND `the replaced teacher is on the reform`

-- 3.8: managers of kindergarten clusters are employed on the pre-reform
-- pay terms until a new collective agreement sets their terms in the
-- reform; notice will follow.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-8
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stays on the pre-reform terms` k IF
    k's `a cluster manager`

§§ `3 Who joins (3.2-3.8 together)`

GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins the reform` k IF
        (NOT `stays on the pre-reform terms` k)
    AND (   `an intern is employed on the reform` k
         OR `an existing academic joins` k
         OR `an existing non-academic joins` k
         OR `joins under 3.4` k)

§§ `4 מבנה שבוע העבודה`

DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `the kindergarten's managing teacher`
    `a complementary teacher`

DECLARE `age band` IS ONE OF
    `under 50`
    `50 to 55, not including 55`
    `55 and over, a new teacher`
    `55 and over, an existing teacher`

@desc One printed cell of the 4.1.1 table.
DECLARE `job base row` HAS
    `band of the row` IS A `age band`
    `post of the row` IS A `kindergarten post`
    `base hours`      IS A NUMBER

-- 4.1.1, one row per printed cell. (The corpus prints the table broken
-- across its table row and ¶2-¶5; the cells are read from those rows.)
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1
`the job base table` MEANS
    LIST `job base row` `under 50` `the kindergarten's managing teacher` 30.8,
         `job base row` `under 50` `a complementary teacher` 33.4,
         `job base row` `50 to 55, not including 55` `the kindergarten's managing teacher` 28.8,
         `job base row` `50 to 55, not including 55` `a complementary teacher` 31.4,
         `job base row` `55 and over, a new teacher` `the kindergarten's managing teacher` 28.8,
         `job base row` `55 and over, a new teacher` `a complementary teacher` 31.4,
         `job base row` `55 and over, an existing teacher` `the kindergarten's managing teacher` 26.8,
         `job base row` `55 and over, an existing teacher` `a complementary teacher` 29.4

GIVEN b IS AN `age band`, p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `job base` b p IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `base hours`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `band of the row` EQUALS b AND r's `post of the row` EQUALS p) `the job base table`))

GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH AN `age band`
DECIDE `the age band of` k IS
    IF k's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 50
    THEN `under 50`
    ELSE IF k's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 55
         THEN `50 to 55, not including 55`
         ELSE IF `an existing teacher` k
              THEN `55 and over, an existing teacher`
              ELSE `55 and over, a new teacher`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-i: the table's asterisk sends the age hours to
-- "סעיף 7 להלן"; section 7 is the mother teacher, the age hours section 8.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the subject of section` n IS
    IF n EQUALS 7
    THEN "a mother teacher"
    ELSE IF n EQUALS 8
         THEN "age hours"
         ELSE "another subject"

`the age-hours pointer reaches the mother section` MEANS
        `the subject of section` 7 EQUALS "a mother teacher"
    AND `the subject of section` 8 EQUALS "age hours"
#ASSERT `the age-hours pointer reaches the mother section`

-- 4.1.2: the managing and complementary teachers' positions are frontal
-- hours only. 4.1.3: work starts at 7:55.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3
`the managing and complementary teachers' positions are frontal hours only` MEANS TRUE

`the start of the working day, in minutes from midnight` MEANS 475

-- 4.1.4: the end of the day by the kindergarten's kind, Sunday to
-- Thursday, and Friday (12:45 in all), in minutes from midnight. The
-- autism and severe-mental-disorder kindergartens that ended at 16:45 or
-- 16:00 before the reform keep their day; the teacher adds forty minutes
-- in overlap. A day ending at 14:00 is 6.08 hours of work.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4
DECLARE `kind of kindergarten` IS ONE OF
    `physical disability`
    `deaf and hard of hearing`
    `blind and visually impaired`
    `moderate intellectual disability`
    `moderate complex intellectual disability`
    `severe, profound or nursing intellectual disability`
    `autism`
    `severe mental disorders`
    `mild intellectual disability`
    `every other kind`

GIVEN k IS A `kind of kindergarten`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `end of the day Sunday to Thursday` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `autism` THEN 1005
    WHEN `severe mental disorders` THEN 960
    WHEN `mild intellectual disability` THEN 840
    WHEN `every other kind` THEN 840
    OTHERWISE 910

`end of the day on Friday` MEANS 765

GIVEN `end minute` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the working day` `end minute` IS
    (`end minute` MINUS `the start of the working day, in minutes from midnight`) DIVIDED BY 60

-- The circular's own figure: a day ending at 14:00 is 6.08 hours.
#ASSERT `hours of the working day` 840 GREATER THAN 6.08 AND `hours of the working day` 840 LESS THAN 6.09

-- 4.1.5: the position is the weekly hours over the job base.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position by the base` `weekly hours` `base` IS
    `weekly hours` DIVIDED BY `base`

-- 4.2 (with art_4 ¶2-¶4, the link printed after it): health professions
-- and arts therapists work 36 hours: 26 frontal, 3 individual (content by
-- the employee with the framework's head) and 7 stay hours, for these.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2 akn:art_4/p2 akn:art_4/p3 akn:art_4/p4
@desc A full position's weekly hours by kind.
DECLARE `week hours` HAS
    `total hours`      IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`    IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours` IS A NUMBER
    `stay hours`       IS A NUMBER

`the health professional's week` MEANS `week hours` 36 26 3 7

GIVEN w IS A `week hours`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the parts add up to the week` w IF
    sum (LIST w's `frontal hours`, w's `individual hours`, w's `stay hours`)
        EQUALS w's `total hours`

-- The three parts add up to the 36 hours.
#ASSERT `the parts add up to the week` `the health professional's week`

DECLARE `stay activity` IS ONE OF
    `adapting the curriculum and environment to the pupil`
    `individual meetings with parents`
    `preparing for and taking part in committees`
    `planning and guiding the special-education assistants`
    `coordination for the pupil's integration in the community`
    `coordination for educational continuity`

§§ `5 העסקה בחלקיות משרה ברפורמה`

-- 5.1: an existing kindergarten teacher at least a third. 5.2: a new one
-- not below 50% (an intern a third), unless the division's head approves
-- the scope and her work week. 5.3: a complementary teacher is employed on
-- the reform once her total scope in reform kindergartens is at least a
-- third — on the reform there, and off it in the others. 5.4: health
-- professions may be below a third. The reading adopted
-- (F-2020-21_tashpa_04-e): 5.2, the clause on a new kindergarten teacher's
-- scope, governs her: below 50% (a third for an intern) she is employed on
-- the reform only with the approval.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-2 akn:art_5__para_5-3 akn:art_5__para_5-4
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
      `approved by the division's head` IS A BOOLEAN
      `scope in reform kindergartens` IS A NUMBER @desc her total scope in the kindergartens moved to the reform
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed at that scope on the reform` k `approved by the division's head` `scope in reform kindergartens` IF
    IF k's `a health professional`
    THEN TRUE
    ELSE IF `an existing teacher` k
         THEN `scope in reform kindergartens` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
         ELSE `may be employed at that scope under 5.2` k `approved by the division's head`

GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`, `approved by the division's head` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed at that scope under 5.2` k `approved by the division's head` IF
       `approved by the division's head`
    OR k's `position fraction` AT LEAST (IF k's `an intern` THEN 1 DIVIDED BY 3 ELSE 0.5)

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-e: 3.4 joins a new academic at a third; 5.2 does
-- not employ a new kindergarten teacher below 50% without approval.

`a new academic at 40%` MEANS
    `kindergarten teacher` WITH
        `recognised years of actual teaching` IS 0
        `seniority in teaching`              IS 0
        `academic`                           IS TRUE
        `certified to teach`                 IS TRUE
        `position fraction`                  IS 0.4
        `signed the academic-studies commitment` IS FALSE
        `approved as an exception`           IS FALSE
        `an intern`                          IS FALSE
        `a health professional`              IS FALSE
        `a cluster manager`                  IS FALSE
        `age on 31 December`                 IS 30

`3.4 joins a new teacher at 40% whom 5.2 does not employ` MEANS
        `joins under 3.4` `a new academic at 40%`
    AND (NOT `may be employed at that scope under 5.2` `a new academic at 40%` FALSE)
#ASSERT `3.4 joins a new teacher at 40% whom 5.2 does not employ`

-- 5.5: a part-time health professional's hours cut in proportion; below a
-- third, frontal hours only, the position being their ratio to the base.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-5
GIVEN h IS A `week hours`, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `week hours`
DECIDE `the part-time week` h f IS
    IF f LESS THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    THEN `week hours` (h's `frontal hours` TIMES f) (h's `frontal hours` TIMES f) 0 0
    ELSE `week hours` (h's `total hours` TIMES f) (h's `frontal hours` TIMES f) (h's `individual hours` TIMES f) (h's `stay hours` TIMES f)

-- 5.6: time below a third does not count toward פז"נ.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-6
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts toward פז"נ` k IF
    k's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

§§ `6 העסקה מעל 100% משרה ברפורמה`

-- 6: kindergarten teachers may be placed up to 126%, and never above 42
-- hours a week.
@ref akn:art_6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `no placement above 126% or 42 hours` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    SHANT `place a kindergarten teacher above the ceiling` `scope` `hours`
          PROVIDED `scope` GREATER THAN 1.26 OR `hours` GREATER THAN 42
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/4 6: kindergarten teachers are placed up to 126% and never above 42 weekly hours"

§§ `7 עובד הוראה אם`

-- 7.1: a mother of a child up to 14, at 79% or more in all.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-1
GIVEN `child's age` IS A NUMBER, `position in all` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has a mother's position` `child's age` `position in all` IF
    `child's age` AT MOST 14 AND `position in all` AT LEAST 0.79

-- 7.2(א): a full day off every two weeks, or half a day a week, with no
-- cut in pay or position. 7.2(ב): one who, by consent and for the system's
-- needs, takes none all year gets 10% more position that year, even above
-- 100%. 7.3: health professions and arts therapists by the linked table.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-2 akn:art_7__para_7-3
DECLARE `a mother's absence` IS ONE OF
    `a full working day once every two weeks`
    `half a working day once a week`

`the absences 7.2(א) allows, pay and position uncut` MEANS
    LIST `a full working day once every two weeks`, `half a working day once a week`

GIVEN `position` IS A NUMBER, `took no absence all year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother kindergarten teacher's position` `position` `took no absence all year` IS
    IF `took no absence all year` THEN `position` PLUS 0.10 ELSE `position`

-- 7.4: back from maternity leave at 90% or more: four months of one
-- nursing hour a day off the stay hours, pay and position uncut; 7.2-7.3
-- do not apply meanwhile; never both reductions together.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-4
DECLARE `mother reduction` IS ONE OF
    `none`
    `the mother's absence of 7.2`
    `five nursing hours a week off the stay hours`

GIVEN `a mother's position` IS A BOOLEAN
      `position` IS A NUMBER
      `months since maternity leave ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `mother reduction`
DECIDE `the mother's reduction` `a mother's position` `position` `months since maternity leave ended` IS
    IF `position` AT LEAST 0.90 AND `months since maternity leave ended` LESS THAN 4
    THEN `five nursing hours a week off the stay hours`
    ELSE IF `a mother's position`
         THEN `the mother's absence of 7.2`
         ELSE `none`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-g: 7.4 takes the nursing hour off the STAY hours,
-- but 4.1.2 makes the kindergarten teacher's position frontal hours only;
-- only the health professionals have stay hours (4.2ג, seven).
GIVEN `a health professional` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `stay hours of a full position` `a health professional` IS
    IF `a health professional`
    THEN `the health professional's week`'s `stay hours`
    ELSE 0

`a kindergarten teacher has no stay hours to take the nursing hour from` MEANS
        `the mother's reduction` FALSE 1 1 EQUALS `five nursing hours a week off the stay hours`
    AND `stay hours of a full position` FALSE LESS THAN 5
#ASSERT `a kindergarten teacher has no stay hours to take the nursing hour from`

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_04-g): a kindergarten teacher
-- takes the five hours off her working (frontal) hours, pay and position
-- uncut.
GIVEN `a health professional` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the hours the nursing hour comes off` `a health professional` IS
    IF `a health professional` THEN "the stay hours" ELSE "the frontal hours"

§§ `8 זכאות לשעות גיל`

-- 8.1: the age on 31 December decides, at the start of the year, for the
-- whole year. 8.3: an existing teacher of 50-55, two frontal hours off the
-- base; 8.4: of 55 and over, four; 8.5: a new teacher of 50 and over, two,
-- and no more at 55; all with the position percentage uncut. 8.6: health
-- professions by the linked tables. "50-55" is read, as the table of 4.1.1
-- prints it, "not including 55".
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-1 akn:art_8__para_8-3 akn:art_8__para_8-4 akn:art_8__para_8-5 akn:art_8__para_8-6
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours off the base` k IS
    IF k's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 50
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF `an existing teacher` k AND k's `age on 31 December` AT LEAST 55
         THEN 4
         ELSE 2

-- The age reductions of section 8 are exactly the steps of the 4.1.1
-- table, for both posts.
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the table steps by section 8` p IF
        `job base` `under 50` p MINUS `job base` `50 to 55, not including 55` p EQUALS 2
    AND `job base` `under 50` p MINUS `job base` `55 and over, a new teacher` p EQUALS 2
    AND `job base` `under 50` p MINUS `job base` `55 and over, an existing teacher` p EQUALS 4

#ASSERT `the table steps by section 8` `the kindergarten's managing teacher`
#ASSERT `the table steps by section 8` `a complementary teacher`

-- 8.2: a part-time teacher of 50 or more gets a PARTIAL reduction, "by the
-- rules detailed below and by the reform's work week". The rules below
-- (8.3-8.5) give whole-position figures only. The reading adopted
-- (F-2020-21_tashpa_04-j): the reduction in proportion to the position, up
-- to one full position.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-2
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours off a part position` k IS
    IF k's `position fraction` LESS THAN 1
    THEN `age hours off the base` k TIMES k's `position fraction`
    ELSE `age hours off the base` k

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-j: the rules 8.2 points to give a half-position
-- teacher the hours of a full position.
`an existing teacher of 52 at half a position` MEANS
    `kindergarten teacher` WITH
        `recognised years of actual teaching` IS 25
        `seniority in teaching`              IS 25
        `academic`                           IS TRUE
        `certified to teach`                 IS TRUE
        `position fraction`                  IS 0.5
        `signed the academic-studies commitment` IS FALSE
        `approved as an exception`           IS FALSE
        `an intern`                          IS FALSE
        `a health professional`              IS FALSE
        `a cluster manager`                  IS FALSE
        `age on 31 December`                 IS 52

`8.3-8.5 give no part-position measure` MEANS
    `age hours off the base` `an existing teacher of 52 at half a position` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `8.3-8.5 give no part-position measure`

§§ `9 שעות פעילות גן`

DECLARE `kindergarten activity` IS ONE OF
    `staff meetings`
    `individual parent-and-child meetings`
    `activity after kindergarten hours`
    `general assemblies`

-- 9.1 (art_9 ¶1-¶2): a teaching employee on the reform, at any position,
-- is paid for kindergarten activities on top of the position and fixed
-- salary. 9.2 (¶3-¶4): allocated by the kindergarten's needs, never more
-- than 18 hours to a teacher in a half-year. 9.3-9.4 (¶5-¶8, art_9 9.4):
-- their purposes, for kindergarten teachers and for health professions.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_9-4
GIVEN `employed on the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid for kindergarten activities on top of the salary` `employed on the reform` IF
    `employed on the reform`

GIVEN a IS A `kindergarten activity`, `a health professional` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an activity-hours purpose` a `a health professional` IF
    IF `a health professional`
    THEN NOT (a EQUALS `staff meetings`)
    ELSE NOT (a EQUALS `general assemblies`)

`activity hours a half-year at most` MEANS 18

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `no more than 18 activity hours a half` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    SHANT `allocate activity hours` `hours`
          PROVIDED `hours` GREATER THAN `activity hours a half-year at most`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/4 9.2: no more than 18 activity hours a half-year"

§§ `10 קידום בדרגות הערכה ופיתוח מקצועי`

@desc One step of a promotion table.
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `step from`          IS A STRING
    `minimum months`     IS A NUMBER
    `development hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `salary rise`        IS A NUMBER

-- 10.1: promotion needs the minimum time, the development hours and an
-- evaluation.
@ref akn:art_10/p1 akn:art_10/p2 akn:art_10/p3 akn:art_10/p4 akn:art_10/p5 akn:art_10/p6 akn:art_10/p7 akn:art_10/p8 akn:art_10/p9 akn:art_10/p10 akn:art_10/p11 akn:art_10/p12
GIVEN s IS A `promotion step`
      `months in the grade` IS A NUMBER
      `development hours done` IS A NUMBER
      `evaluated as the Ministry directs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` s `months in the grade` `development hours done` `evaluated as the Ministry directs` IF
        `months in the grade` AT LEAST s's `minimum months`
    AND `development hours done` AT LEAST s's `development hours`
    AND `evaluated as the Ministry directs`

-- 10.2.1: certified academics. The corpus's table carries a ninth row,
-- the heading of 10.2.2, which is not a step (corpus defect).
@ref akn:art_10/p13 akn:art_10/p14 akn:art_10/p15 akn:art_10/p16 akn:art_10/p17 akn:art_10/p18 akn:art_10/p19 akn:art_10/t1
`promotion of certified academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "1-2" 30 120 0.075, `promotion step` "2-3" 30 120 0.075,
         `promotion step` "3-4" 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` "4-5" 36 180 0.075,
         `promotion step` "5-6" 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` "6-7" 48 210 0.075,
         `promotion step` "7-8" 48 210 0.075, `promotion step` "8-9" 48 210 0.075

-- 10.2.3: certified non-academics with 28 years or more.
@ref akn:art_10/p26 akn:art_10/p27 akn:art_10/p28 akn:art_10/p29 akn:art_10/p30 akn:art_10/p31 akn:art_10/p32 akn:art_10/t2
`promotion of certified non-academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "1-2" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "2-3" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "3-4" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "4-5" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "5-6" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "6-7" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "7-8" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "8-9" 48 480 0.075

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_04-d): 25 exempts, as 3.2.1 bars
-- only "below 25". Veterans below 25, once certified, count פז"נ and שפ"מ
-- from their employment on the reform, for one promotion, and up to 60
-- hours of their studies; new teachers admitted by exception from the
-- certification. Committed non-academics advance once they present the
-- degree.
@ref akn:art_10/p20 akn:art_10/p21 akn:art_10/p22 akn:art_10/p23 akn:art_10/p24 akn:art_10/p25
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
      `presented the academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may advance in grades` k `presented the academic degree` IF
    IF k's `academic`
    THEN k's `certified to teach` OR k's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 25
    ELSE k's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 28 OR `presented the academic degree`

`study hours that count toward שפ"מ at most` MEANS 60

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-d: 10.2.2 bars veterans "בעלי ותק עד 25 שנה" and
-- exempts those "בעלי ותק של 25 שנה ומעלה": at 25 years, both.
GIVEN `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred under 10.2.2` `seniority` IF
    `seniority` AT MOST 25

GIVEN `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exempt under 10.2.2` `seniority` IF
    `seniority` AT LEAST 25

`at 25 years 10.2.2 both bars and exempts` MEANS
    `barred under 10.2.2` 25 AND `exempt under 10.2.2` 25
#ASSERT `at 25 years 10.2.2 both bars and exempts`

§§ `11 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- 11 ¶1: at this stage the setting of grades cannot yet begin.
@ref akn:art_11/p1
`the setting of אופק חדש grades can begin yet` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:art_11/p2 Background: the Ministry is building the system on which the initial grade will rest; no rule.

-- 11.2-11.3: the grade rests on the employment, education and salary data;
-- an existing teacher's is set by the Ministry's accountant by conversion,
-- by the employment and salary data of March in the year before she moved
-- to the reform: seniority, education grade, in-service training
-- allowances, role and the stage she taught in, as the agreement sets.
@ref akn:art_11/p4 akn:art_11/p5 akn:art_11/p6
@desc The March data a grade is converted from (section 11.3).
DECLARE `conversion data` HAS
    `seniority of the data`             IS A NUMBER
    `education grade of the data`       IS A NUMBER
    `in-service training allowances`    IS A NUMBER
    `role of the data`                  IS A STRING
    `stage taught`                      IS A STRING

-- 11.4: the salary to convert is the relevant components that do not
-- continue in the move, that a 100% position would earn by her roles that
-- March.
@ref akn:art_11/p7 akn:art_11/p8
GIVEN `March salary components that do not continue` IS A NUMBER
      `position fraction that March` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `salary to convert at 100%` `March salary components that do not continue` `position fraction that March` IS
    `March salary components that do not continue` DIVIDED BY `position fraction that March`

-- 11.5: the grade set in the conversion may be a half grade.
@ref akn:art_11/p9
`grades may be halves` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:art_11/p10 akn:art_11/p11 akn:art_11/p12 akn:art_11/p13 akn:art_11/p14 akn:art_11/p15 11.6: more information on the conversions and the owners' conferences will follow; links to the אופק חדש tables and the 2016 shekel-supplement circular. A pointer, no rule.

§§ `12 מקדמות שכר באופק חדש עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- 12.1-12.2: until the grade is set, an advance on top of the present
-- salary, on these components, for the share at the joined kindergarten,
-- from joining; afterwards the salary is recomputed back to joining and
-- what was paid, the advance included, is offset.
DECLARE `advance kind` IS ONE OF
    `an academic kindergarten teacher`
    `an academic health professional`
    `an intern, kindergarten teacher or health professional`
    `a non-academic of 28 years or more, or who signed the commitment`
    `a non-academic who neither has 28 years nor signed`

-- 12.3: the rates.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3
GIVEN k IS AN `advance kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `advance rate` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `an academic kindergarten teacher` THEN 0.16
    WHEN `an academic health professional` THEN 0.17
    WHEN `an intern, kindergarten teacher or health professional` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `a non-academic of 28 years or more, or who signed the commitment` THEN 0.10
    WHEN `a non-academic who neither has 28 years nor signed` THEN 0

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-1 akn:art_12__para_12-2
GIVEN k IS AN `advance kind`
      `the advance components of the present salary` IS A NUMBER @desc combined salary, the 87, 94, 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements, profession and training, in-service and double-degree allowances, in shekels
      `share of employment at the joined kindergarten` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the אופק חדש advance` k `the advance components of the present salary` `share of employment at the joined kindergarten` IS
    `advance rate` k
    TIMES `the advance components of the present salary`
    TIMES `share of employment at the joined kindergarten`

GIVEN `advance due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `paying the advance` `advance due` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the אופק חדש advance` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `advance due`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/4 12: the advance is paid on top of the salary until the grade is set"

§§ `13 והתחייבות הבעלות`

-- 13 (art_13 ¶1): where the circular contradicts the agreements, for or
-- against the employee, the agreements govern.
@ref akn:art_13/p1
DECLARE `source` IS ONE OF `this circular`, `the collective agreements`

GIVEN `they contradict` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `source`
DECIDE `what governs` `they contradict` IS
    IF `they contradict` THEN `the collective agreements` ELSE `this circular`

-- akn:art_13/p2 The sign-off ("בברכה"), printed inside section 13 in the corpus; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p3 The signatories; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p4 The signatories' posts; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p5 The signatories' posts; no rule.
