-- akn:art_13/p7 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p8 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p9 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p10 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p11 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p12 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p13 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p14 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p15 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p16 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p17 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p18 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p19 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p20 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p21 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p22 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p23 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p24 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p25 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p26 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p27 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p28 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p29 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p30 Copies list; no rule.

-- The owner's commitment (art_13 ¶31 on, printed inside section 13 in the
-- corpus): sent by 1.1.2021; the owner undertakes (1) to apply the אופק
-- חדש agreement of 25.12.2008 and its amendments from תשפ"א — the work
-- week, the length of the day, the pay and the pedagogical instructions;
-- (2) to transfer the data the Ministry asks; (3) to pay the advance,
-- marking it on the payslip (א), sending each teacher the letter of annex
-- A (ב) and having each sign annex B's undertaking (ג); (4) to keep the
-- undertakings and send them on demand; (5) to have each teacher short of
-- the qualifications sign a completion commitment and send it; (6) to send
-- the payslips on demand; (7) a teacher may ask the exceptions committee,
-- through the owner, not to join (annex E). Breach: sanctions, offsetting
-- the budget, up to the licence.
@ref akn:art_13/p31 akn:art_13/p32 akn:art_13/p33 akn:art_13/p34 akn:art_13__para_1 akn:art_13__para_2 akn:art_13__para_3 akn:art_13__para_4 akn:art_13__para_6 akn:art_13__para_7/p1 akn:art_13__para_7/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owner's commitment` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `employ the eligible teachers on אופק חדש terms`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `transfer the data required`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `mark the advance on the payslip`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `send each teacher the advance letter`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `have each teacher sign the advance undertaking`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `keep the undertakings and send them on demand`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `send the payslips on demand`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teaching employee`
     MAY   `file a request to leave`)

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_04-b): each form is the one its
-- clause describes, whatever its letter — the exception request (3.2.1),
-- the academic-studies commitment (3.3.1) — and no teaching-certificate
-- form is attached. Item 5: the owner has each teacher short of the
-- qualifications (a degree or equivalent grade and/or a teaching
-- certificate) who asks to be employed on the reform sign a commitment to
-- complete them, and sends it to the Ministry.
@ref akn:art_13__para_5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `having the unqualified sign` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `have the unqualified sign a completion commitment`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_04-b: the letters of the annexes. 3.2.1 sends the
-- exception request on "נספח ג"; 3.3.1 puts the academic-studies commitment
-- in "נספח ד'"; the commitment's item 5 puts the academic-studies
-- commitment in annex ג' and a commitment to complete a TEACHING
-- CERTIFICATE in annex ד' — a form none of the attached is.
DECLARE `form` IS ONE OF
    `the exception request`
    `the academic-studies commitment`
    `a teaching-certificate commitment`

GIVEN f IS A `form`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the annex letters the text gives` f IS
    CONSIDER f
    WHEN `the exception request` THEN LIST "ג"
    WHEN `the academic-studies commitment` THEN LIST "ד", "ג"
    WHEN `a teaching-certificate commitment` THEN LIST "ד"

`the annexes are lettered two ways` MEANS
        count (`the annex letters the text gives` `the academic-studies commitment`) EQUALS 2
    AND elem "ג" (`the annex letters the text gives` `the exception request`)
    AND elem "ג" (`the annex letters the text gives` `the academic-studies commitment`)
#ASSERT `the annexes are lettered two ways`

-- akn:art_13__para_7/p4 The signature block's heading; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_7/p5 The signature block's columns; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_7/p6 The signature block's columns; no rule.
-- akn:art_13/p35 The date line; no rule.

§§ `נספחים א'-ב' המקדמה`

-- Annex A, the letter (kept by the owner): the teacher moved to אופק חדש;
-- her grade and pay will be set by the Ministry; meanwhile an advance,
-- marked "מקדמת אופק חדש", to be deducted in full — with the pre-reform
-- salary — when she is paid by the grade, subject to the Wage Protection
-- Law, 1958. Annex B, her undertaking: she knows the component is an
-- advance, deducted in full, and waives any claim.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p9 akn:att_1__hc_1/p10 akn:att_1__hc_1/p11 akn:att_1__hc_1/p12 akn:att_1__hc_1/p13 akn:att_1__hc_1/p14 akn:att_1__hc_1/p15 akn:att_1__hc_1/p16 akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1/p6
GIVEN `salary by the grade from joining` IS A NUMBER
      `pre-reform salary paid` IS A NUMBER
      `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the balance once the grade is set` `salary by the grade from joining` `pre-reform salary paid` `advances paid` IS
    `salary by the grade from joining`
    MINUS `pre-reform salary paid`
    MINUS `advances paid`

