§§ `נספח ג' התחייבות להשלמת תואר`

-- The academic-studies commitment of a kindergarten teacher without a
-- degree: sent by 31.1.2021. ¶10-¶11 (four years, the differences) are
-- encoded with 3.3.4 — F-2020-21_tashpa_04-c. A degree is one of three
-- alternatives (here and in the exception request's note); the reform's
-- terms apply on signing (¶17).
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1/p12 akn:att_3__hc_1/p13 akn:att_3__hc_1/p14 akn:att_3__hc_1/p15 akn:att_3__hc_1/p16 akn:att_3__hc_1/p17 akn:att_4__hc_1/p11 akn:att_4__hc_1/p12 akn:att_4__hc_1/p13 akn:att_4__hc_1/p14 akn:att_4__hc_1/p15 akn:att_4__hc_1/p16
DECLARE `academic degree alternative` IS ONE OF
    `a degree of a recognised Israeli institution recognised by the Council for Higher Education`
    `a foreign degree the Ministry's evaluation unit found equivalent`
    `studies giving a salary grade equal to the academic one, approved by the division or a district`

GIVEN a IS AN `academic degree alternative`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic degree for the forms` a IF TRUE

GIVEN `signed the academic-studies commitment form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reform's terms apply on signing the academic-studies commitment` `signed the academic-studies commitment form` IF
    `signed the academic-studies commitment form`

